  <Callout kind="remember">
    Anything that cannot see the canvas reads JSON from <code>__PIXI_REELS_DEBUG</code>;
    anyone who can see it turns on <code>debugOverlay()</code>. Both only read, both
    come from the same facts, and neither is API you should build on. If a spin feels
    wrong, the timeline panel will usually tell you which reel and by how many
    milliseconds.
  </Callout>
